    getSubscriptionContract()
    assertCurrent()
    recordAcceptance()
    getLatestAcceptance()
  }
}

class "Pagamento (Payment)" as Payment <<modelo>>
class "Assinatura (Subscription)" as Subscription <<modelo>>
class "Aceite do contrato\n(ContractAcceptance)" as ContractAcceptance <<modelo>>

PaymentsController --> PaymentsService : encaminha solicitações
SubscriptionsController --> SubscriptionsService : encaminha solicitações
ContractsController --> ContractsService : encaminha solicitações
PaymentsService ..> Payment : registra cobranças
PaymentsService ..> ContractsService : valida contrato
PaymentsService ..> AsaasService : consulta e cobra
SubscriptionsService ..> Subscription : atualiza assinatura
SubscriptionsService ..> PaymentsService : sincroniza cobranças
SubscriptionsService ..> AsaasService : agenda renovação
SubscriptionsCheckService ..> SubscriptionsService : verifica vencimentos
SubscriptionsCheckService ..> PaymentsService : sincroniza pagamentos
ContractsService ..> ContractAcceptance : registra aceite
@enduml

